      :objects
      {:G
       {:text
        "    Local success and global trust coincide only when the property is local.\n    A compiler run cannot by itself establish axiom cleanliness, source grep\n    cannot see imported placeholders, and a matching top-level hash cannot see\n    unhashed meaning changes.  Probing the promised property prevents the gate\n    from certifying a different, easier claim.\n",
        :source
        {:path
         "futon3/library/pattern-mining/probe-the-claimed-property-not-the-acceptance-proxy.flexiarg",
